@startuml UC07 - Human Review - Sequence Diagram
title UC07 - Human Review - Sequence Diagram

participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Next.js" as FE
actor "Sales User" as Sales

N8N -> API : 1. Submit low-confidence result
API -> DB : 2. Create ReviewTask
DB --> API : 3. ReviewTask created
API -> DB : 4. Create Notification
DB --> API : 5. Notification saved
API --> FE : 6. Review available
Sales -> FE : 7. Open Review Task
FE -> API : 8. Get Review Task
API -> DB : 9. Get Task and Lead
DB --> API : 10. Return Review data
Sales -> FE : 11. Approve / Reject
FE -> API : 12. Resolve Review Task

@enduml
